# Coaching Cues

Fight for inside control.

Maintain posture.

Use the whole body.

Move the feet.

Break grips immediately.

Never chase the hands.

---

# Common Errors

Using only arm strength.

Standing upright.

Watching the hands.

Poor foot positioning.

Holding grips too long.

